  "prompt": "ACCESS POLICY:\nA student's enrollment records (semester, course, grade) may be viewed only by that student or by an admin.\n\nENDPOINT: GET /me/courses\nTARGET FUNCTION: app.routers.courses.get_my_courses (the handler of this endpoint)\n\nCODE:\n```python\n# file: app/auth.py\ndef get_current_user(credentials: HTTPAuthorizationCredentials=Depends(bearer_scheme), db: Session=Depends(get_db)) -> User:\n    user = db.get(User, credentials.credentials)\n    if user is None:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=status.HTTP_401_UNAUTHORIZED, detail='Invalid token')\n    return user\n\n# file: app/database.py\ndef get_db():\n    db = SessionLocal()\n    try:\n        yield db\n    finally:\n        db.close()\n\n# file: app/routers/courses.py\n@router.get('/me/courses', response_model=list[EnrollmentOut])\ndef get_my_courses(current_user: User=Depends(get_current_user), db: Session=Depends(get_db)):\n    enrollments = db.query(Enrollment).filter(Enrollment.student_id == current_user.id).all()\n    return enrollments\n```\n\nCONTEXT NOTE:\nOnly selected functions from the codebase are shown. Classes (including data models and schemas) and module-level variables are not shown.\nCalls not shown:\n- db.get(...) called in app.auth.get_current_user: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n- HTTPException(...) called in app.auth.get_current_user: not resolved by the extractor (imported), body not shown\n- bearer_scheme(...) called in app.auth.get_current_user: not resolved by the extractor (depends_unresolved), body not shown\n- SessionLocal(...) called in app.database.get_db: not resolved by the extractor (module_variable), body not shown\n- db.close(...) called in app.database.get_db: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n- db.query(Enrollment).filter(Enrollment.student_id == current_user.id).all(...) called in app.routers.courses.get_my_courses: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n- db.query(Enrollment).filter(...) called in app.routers.courses.get_my_courses: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n- db.query(...) called in app.routers.courses.get_my_courses: not resolved by the extractor (attribute_call), body not shown\n\nReturn the JSON object.",
